                                                        <p class="brfprofile">Tanishq Maheshwari is an accomplished Soft Skills and Personality Development Trainer with a diverse background in education, talent acquisition, and entrepreneurship. With a strong focus on personal branding, communication, and interview preparation, he has trained over 1,000 students, helping them build confidence and essential skills for the professional world. Having worked closely with PGDM students, he delivers engaging workshops on leadership, teamwork, and resume crafting, preparing students for corporate success. As a former Talent Acquisition Specialist and co-founder of Expert Aroma Pvt. Ltd., he brings a well-rounded understanding of industry standards and professional development. His experience spans corporate training, hospitality, and coaching, demonstrating his dedication to empowering individuals to achieve their personal and career growth objectives.</p>

